-- and over the hurdles, a lap of the stadium, the big feature a tight, steep
-- banked turn raised high over the dunes, S-bends through the dunes and the
-- home straight; a minaret start; in the Track and Field pack, not free;
-- switched off until Moses has watched the preview). It is added switched off:
